<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Model Architecture</h3>

<figure id="A1.F3" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.05282v1/arch.svg" id="A1.F3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/264;" width="476" height="264"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span><span id="A1.F3.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model Architecture.</span> Model architecture diagram of Decay Linear Transformer: Each Decay Linear Transformer consists of multiple Decay Linear Transformer Layers, with each Layer comprising Decay Linear Attention and GLU; for Decay Linear Attention, its computational logic is shown in the right figure.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Decay computation</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">For decay, we first obtain activation </span><math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{F}^{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐅</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{F}^{j}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> through linear layers, then calculate </span><math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda_{t}^{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda_{t}^{j}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> through function </span><math id="A1.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (whose form is determined by the </span><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Parameterization Strategy</span><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, see Table </span><a href="#S3.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 3 Preliminary ‣ Elucidating the Design Space of Decay in Linear Attention" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">). For vector decay, we use low-rank mapping to minimize the impact of parameter count on our conclusions (when comparing scalar decay and vector decay without low-rank mapping, the former would have </span><math id="A1.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d^{2}-dh" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d^{2}-dh</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> fewer parameters than the latter, which is far greater than the difference when using low-rank mapping: </span><math id="A1.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2d(d/h)-dh" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2d(d/h)-dh</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">). The detailed computation is listed as E.q. </span><a href="#A1.E5" title="In A.2 Decay computation ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Elucidating the Design Space of Decay in Linear Attention" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E5" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E5X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E5X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{F}^{j}=\begin{cases}\mathbf{X}\mathbf{W}_{d_{1}}^{j},&amp;\text{scalar decay},\\
\mathbf{X}\mathbf{W}_{d_{2}}\mathbf{W}_{d_{3}}^{j},&amp;\text{vector decay with out parameter sharing},\\
\mathbf{X}\mathbf{W}_{d_{4}},&amp;\text{vector decay with parameter sharing,}\end{cases}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐅</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐗𝐖</mi><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext mathsize="0.900em">scalar decay</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐗𝐖</mi><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐖</mi><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">3</mn></msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mtext mathsize="0.900em">vector decay with out parameter sharing</mtext><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐗𝐖</mi><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">4</mn></msub></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext mathsize="0.900em">vector decay with parameter sharing,</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{F}^{j}=\begin{cases}\mathbf{X}\mathbf{W}_{d_{1}}^{j},&amp;\text{scalar decay},\\
\mathbf{X}\mathbf{W}_{d_{2}}\mathbf{W}_{d_{3}}^{j},&amp;\text{vector decay with out parameter sharing},\\
\mathbf{X}\mathbf{W}_{d_{4}},&amp;\text{vector decay with parameter sharing,}\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(5)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E5Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E5Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\lambda_{t}^{j}=f(\mathbf{f}_{t}^{j}),\mathbf{W}_{d_{1}}^{j}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times 1},\mathbf{W}_{d_{2}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d/h},\mathbf{W}_{d_{3}}^{j}\in\mathbb{R}^{d/h\times d/h},\mathbf{W}_{d_{4}}^{j}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d/h},j=1,\ldots,h." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐟</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐖</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐖</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msub></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐖</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">3</mn></msub></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐖</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">4</mn></msub></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\lambda_{t}^{j}=f(\mathbf{f}_{t}^{j}),\mathbf{W}_{d_{1}}^{j}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times 1},\mathbf{W}_{d_{2}}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d/h},\mathbf{W}_{d_{3}}^{j}\in\mathbb{R}^{d/h\times d/h},\mathbf{W}_{d_{4}}^{j}\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d/h},j=1,\ldots,h.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Compatibility between Decay and RoPE</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">In subsequent discussions, we omit the head superscript </span><math id="A1.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> to simplify notation.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Assuming we apply RoPE to </span><math id="A1.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{q}_{t},\mathbf{k}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐪</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{q}_{t},\mathbf{k}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> to obtain </span><math id="A1.SS3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\bar{q}}_{t},\mathbf{\bar{k}}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐪</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\bar{q}}_{t},\mathbf{\bar{k}}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\bar{y}}_{t}=\mathbf{R}_{t}\mathbf{y}_{t}\in\mathbb{R}^{d},\mathbf{R}_{t}=\mathrm{diag}(\mathbf{R}_{t,1},\ldots,\mathbf{R}_{t,d/2}),\mathbf{R}_{t,j}=\left[\begin{matrix}\cos(t\theta_{j})&amp;-\sin(t\theta_{j})\\
\sin(t\theta_{j})&amp;\cos(t\theta_{j})\end{matrix}\right],\mathbf{y}\in\{\mathbf{q},\mathbf{k}\}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐲</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐲</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></mrow></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd><mtd><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐲</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">{</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐪</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\bar{y}}_{t}=\mathbf{R}_{t}\mathbf{y}_{t}\in\mathbb{R}^{d},\mathbf{R}_{t}=\mathrm{diag}(\mathbf{R}_{t,1},\ldots,\mathbf{R}_{t,d/2}),\mathbf{R}_{t,j}=\left[\begin{matrix}\cos(t\theta_{j})&amp;-\sin(t\theta_{j})\\
\sin(t\theta_{j})&amp;\cos(t\theta_{j})\end{matrix}\right],\mathbf{y}\in\{\mathbf{q},\mathbf{k}\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(6)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Then according to the Linear Attention recurrence equation:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E7" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E7X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E7X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{s}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐬</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{s}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E7X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathrm{diag}(\lambda_{t})\mathbf{s}_{t-1}+\mathbf{\bar{k}}_{t}\mathbf{v}_{t}^{\top}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐬</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathrm{diag}(\lambda_{t})\mathbf{s}_{t-1}+\mathbf{\bar{k}}_{t}\mathbf{v}_{t}^{\top},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="6" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(7)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E7Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E7Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\gamma_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\gamma_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E7Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\triangleq\prod_{j=1}^{t}\lambda_{j}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">≜</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∏</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\triangleq\prod_{j=1}^{t}\lambda_{j},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E7Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E7Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{s}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐬</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{s}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E7Xb.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathrm{diag}(\gamma_{t})\sum_{j=1}^{t}\mathrm{diag}(1/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{\bar{k}}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathrm{diag}(\gamma_{t})\sum_{j=1}^{t}\mathrm{diag}(1/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{\bar{k}}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E7Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E7Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{o}_{t}^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐨</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{o}_{t}^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E7Xc.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{\bar{q}}_{t}^{\top}\mathbf{s}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐪</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐬</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{\bar{q}}_{t}^{\top}\mathbf{s}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E7Xd" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E7Xd.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{\bar{q}}_{t}^{\top}\mathrm{diag}(\gamma_{t})\sum_{j=1}^{t}\mathrm{diag}(1/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{\bar{k}}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐪</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">diag</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{\bar{q}}_{t}^{\top}\mathrm{diag}(\gamma_{t})\sum_{j=1}^{t}\mathrm{diag}(1/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{\bar{k}}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E7Xe" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E7Xe.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(\mathrm{diag}(\gamma_{t})\mathbf{R}_{t}\mathbf{q}_{t})^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}\mathrm{diag}(1/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐪</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(\mathrm{diag}(\gamma_{t})\mathbf{R}_{t}\mathbf{q}_{t})^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}\mathrm{diag}(1/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">When the elements of </span><math id="A1.SS3.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS3.p2.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> are all identical (scalar decay), the above expression can be simplified to:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E8" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E8X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E8X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{o}_{t}^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐨</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{o}_{t}^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E8X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(\mathrm{diag}(\gamma_{t})\mathbf{R}_{t}\mathbf{q}_{t})^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}\mathrm{diag}(1/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐪</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">diag</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(\mathrm{diag}(\gamma_{t})\mathbf{R}_{t}\mathbf{q}_{t})^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}\mathrm{diag}(1/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="4" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(8)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E8Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E8Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\gamma_{t}(\mathbf{R}_{t}\mathbf{q}_{t})^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}(1/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐪</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\gamma_{t}(\mathbf{R}_{t}\mathbf{q}_{t})^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}(1/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E8Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E8Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{q}_{t}^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}(\gamma_{t}/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{t}^{\top}\mathbf{R}_{j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐪</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{q}_{t}^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}(\gamma_{t}/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{t}^{\top}\mathbf{R}_{j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E8Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E8Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{q}_{t}^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}(\gamma_{t}/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{t-j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐪</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{q}_{t}^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}(\gamma_{t}/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{t-j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">When </span><math id="A1.SS3.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS3.p2.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> is vector decay, assuming </span><math id="A1.SS3.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS3.p2.4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> has the form:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{t}^{\top}=[\gamma_{t,1},\gamma_{t,1},\ldots,\gamma_{t,d/2},\gamma_{t,d/2}]\in\mathbb{R}^{d}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{t}^{\top}=[\gamma_{t,1},\gamma_{t,1},\ldots,\gamma_{t,d/2},\gamma_{t,d/2}]\in\mathbb{R}^{d}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Since </span><math id="A1.SS3.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{R}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{R}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS3.p2.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> is a block-diagonal matrix with block size 2, for each block, </span><math id="A1.SS3.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{t}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.SS3.p2.5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> acts as scalar decay, so it also satisfies:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E10X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbf{o}_{t}^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐨</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbf{o}_{t}^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbf{q}_{t}^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}(\gamma_{t}/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{t-j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐪</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐑</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐤</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝐯</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">j</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbf{q}_{t}^{\top}\sum_{j=1}^{t}(\gamma_{t}/\gamma_{j})\mathbf{R}_{t-j}\mathbf{k}_{j}\mathbf{v}_{j}^{\top}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Since vector decay requires special design to satisfy RoPE’s relative positional properties (reducing decay’s degrees of freedom by half), to simplify the problem, all our experiments are conducted with scalar decay.</span></p>
</div>
</section>
